{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05682","headline":"和咏廨署有樱桃 · 孙逖","name":"和咏廨署有樱桃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上林天禁里，芳树有红樱。\n江国今来见，君门春意生。\n香从花绶转，色绕佩珠明。\n海鸟衔初实，吴姬扫落英。\n切将稀取贵，羞与衆同荣。\n爲此堪攀折，芳蹊处处成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}